{"title": "Chessa's Practice Sword", "pageid": 19862, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Chessa's_Practice_Sword", "categories": ["Equipment", "Weapons", "Melee weapons", "Simple weapons", "Shortswords", "Common items", "Sources of Bludgeoning damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Practice_Sword_Unfaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img alt=\"Chessa's Practice Sword controller icon\" src=\"/w/images/3/33/Practice_Sword_Unfaded.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"144\" height=\"144\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/33/Practice_Sword_Unfaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong>Chessa's Practice Sword</strong> is a mundane, nonmagical variant of the <a href=\"/wiki/Shortswords\" title=\"Shortswords\">Shortswords</a> family of weapons. It is a <a href=\"/wiki/Weapons\" title=\"Weapons\">simple melee weapon</a> wielded in one hand. As a <a href=\"/wiki/Finesse\" title=\"Finesse\">finesse</a> weapon, it can benefit from the wielder's Dexterity and not just their Strength. It's a <a href=\"/wiki/Light_(weapon_property)\" title=\"Light (weapon property)\">light</a> weapon that anyone can dual-wield without special training.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A wooden sword coated in a thick layer of varnish. Well-loved, its handle is engraved with the name \"Chessa\".\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Damage</dt>\n<dd><div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/46px-D4_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/62px-D4_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/D4_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">1d4 (1~4) + <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Roll#Modifiers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Roll\">Strength or Dexterity modifier</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a></span> </div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shortswords\" title=\"Shortswords\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png/25px-Shortswords_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png/38px-Shortswords_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png/50px-Shortswords_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shortswords\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png/25px-Shortswords_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Shortswords_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shortswords\" title=\"Shortswords\">Shortswords</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</dd>